                "loc": "DEU.22.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 22:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kpweli náambirwa kukala kuna atu adiya kahi yenu. Tsona udiya uhu ni wa kpwaangalaza sana. Unatsapa hata wa atu asiomkuluphira Mlungu, mana myawenu mmwenga anazinga na mkpwaza ise! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na badala ya kusikira utsungu mwenu mioyoni na mjute, enye muna ngulu! Hiye ariye na ndzimo hiyo, mtengeni na afuasi ayae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana hata dzagbwe si phamwenga namwi chimwiri, bado ni phamwenga namwi chiroho. Nami nkalavya hukumu yangu kare kpwa hiye ariyehenda waibu hinyo kama avi nami ni kuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi wakati munaphokutana, ndakala phamwenga namwi chiroho, na uwezo wa Bwana Jesu piya undakala phapho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati hinyo mulavyeni kpwa Shetani mutu hiye ariyehenda higo mai, ili mwiriwe ubanangbwe na rohoye yookolwe ni Bwana Jesu siku ya chiyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
